      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Self-hosted SmithDB vitals.** Companion to the [SmithDB metrics reference](https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/self-host-smithdb-metrics). Scope with the **namespace** variable. Metric names are as SmithDB exposes them on `/metrics`, with no prefix. `langsmith_*` metrics are emitted by LangSmith."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "At a glance",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Green means healthy: query and ingest latency flat, pending counts steady, and all four error tiles at zero for the selected time range. Pending compaction jobs and compaction failures are separate signals: jobs can fail while the queue stays flat, and the queue can grow while every job succeeds. [Baseline metrics](https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/self-host-smithdb-metrics#baseline-metrics)"
      }
    },
