      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Emitted by LangSmith, not SmithDB. End-to-end latency is the user-facing number; during dual ingestion compare `store=\"smithdb\"` against `store=\"clickhouse\"`. If **API to worker** rises, the LangSmith queue is the bottleneck, not SmithDB. If **Worker to store** rises, SmithDB writes are slow. [LangSmith ingestion path](https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/self-host-smithdb-metrics#langsmith-ingestion-path)"
      }
    },
